{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>You shall fear.</b> That you not transgress negative commandments." "<b>You shall serve.</b> In positive commandments." "<b>And by His name you shall swear.</b> Not in the name of other elohim to establish a matter or to cut a covenant, and likewise you may swear in any tongue, only in truth. And the reason: you shall not have an elohah in whose name you swear, only the name of HaShem alone. Therefore it is written after it: You shall not go after other elohim, and you shall not test."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:22:37.789353990Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}